===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|North America}} An open area, generally paved, where automobiles may be left when not in use.
#: {{ux|en|Should we park in that '''parking lot''', or in the garage up the street?}}
#* {{quote-song|en|year=1970|author={{w|Joni Mitchell}}|title={{w|Big Yellow Taxi}}|text=They paved paradise and put up a '''parking lot'''.}}
# {{lb|en|US|figuratively|humorous}} A [[road]] blocked by [[stop-start]] [[traffic]].
#: {{ux|en|The 101 was a '''parking lot''' again today.}}

